  ('9056e17f-9088-473e-af81-da7dd8690785', '401cde19-87ad-4060-8553-7cce8905fc38', '2bbce190-3877-4af3-bdfd-9dc1336c17a1', 'SKX-2026-3268', 'python', '7af504fc-07ce-49ae-ac82-daa41649053d', 1, 'Library Automation Tool', 'https://github.com/vaishnavi-05-wq/Task1_Calculator_App', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'Developed a feature-rich CLI Calculator App using Python as part of the Skyrovix Internship Task 1.\n\nThe application supports addition, subtraction, multiplication, division, modulus, and power operations. It also includes calculation history, history viewing, history clearing, input validation, and error handling for invalid operations and division/modulus by zero.\n\nThe project includes automated unit tests using Python\'s unittest framework. All 11 tests passed successfully.\n\nTechnologies used: Python 3.12 and Python Standard Library.\n\nThe project is organized with separate source code, test files, requirements, README documentation, and Git configuration.', 'Vaishnavi chouhan', 'vaishnavisinghchouhan717@gmail.com', '2026-09-20 08:54:13', '2026-09-20 10:07:30', 0, '7af504fc-07ce-49ae-ac82-daa41649053d', 'Library Automation Tool', 'https://github.com/vaishnavi-05-wq/Task1_Calculator_App', '', '2026-09-20 08:54:13', '2026-09-20 10:07:30'),
