  ('58e9473d-6ab0-4750-a0aa-7c090ce2072c', '401cde19-87ad-4060-8553-7cce8905fc38', '2bbce190-3877-4af3-bdfd-9dc1336c17a1', 'SKX-2026-3268', 'python', '110857f3-43eb-4e53-ae61-eddb4cd458ea', 2, 'Student Result Analyzer', 'https://github.com/vaishnavi-05-wq/Task2_Web_Scraper', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'Developed a Python-based Web Scraper as part of the Skyrovix Internship Task 2.\n\nThe project uses Requests and BeautifulSoup to extract book information from the Books to Scrape website. The scraper collects the book title, price, rating, and availability.\n\nThe scraper supports multi-page scraping, rate limiting, error handling, CSV export, and automated testing.\n\nThe current implementation successfully scraped 3 pages containing 60 books and generated the data/books.csv file.\n\nAutomated testing was performed using Python unittest, and all 3 tests passed successfully.\n\nTechnologies used: Python 3.12, Requests, BeautifulSoup4, CSV, pathlib, and unittest.\n\nGitHub repository contains the complete source code, tests, CSV output, README documentation, requirements.txt, and .gitignore.', 'Vaishnavi chouhan', 'vaishnavisinghchouhan717@gmail.com', '2026-09-20 16:51:18', '2026-09-21 00:55:52', 0, '110857f3-43eb-4e53-ae61-eddb4cd458ea', 'Student Result Analyzer', 'https://github.com/vaishnavi-05-wq/Task2_Web_Scraper', '', '2026-09-20 16:51:18', '2026-09-21 00:55:52'),
