  ('7fd03508-3bfc-4b39-acf7-4e5a02a07cab', '3745d8af-8104-4247-9777-49aacae85343', '454d7779-cd5e-4ee9-87a3-691f26ab9af7', 'SKX-2026-9647', 'python', '76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08', 3, 'File Management Utility', 'https://github.com/ankita-yaduwanshi12/File-management-utility', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'File Management Utility is a Python-based project used to easily manage files and folders. It allows users to create, view, rename, copy, and delete files through a simple menu-driven interface.\nThe project uses Python modules such as os and shutil for file operations. It also includes input validation and error handling to make the application safe and user-friendly.\nTechnologies Used: Python, OS Module, Shutil Module\nOutcome: A simple and useful utility for managing files efficiently.', 'Ankita Yaduvanshi', 'ankitayaduvanshi22@gmail.com', '2026-09-21 17:24:31', '2026-09-21 17:33:32', 0, '76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08', 'File Management Utility', 'https://github.com/ankita-yaduwanshi12/File-management-utility', '', '2026-09-21 17:24:31', '2026-09-21 17:33:32'),
  ('e50c80b0-b1eb-4bda-8af8-177d8ae2c9d8', '275f94d5-3a27-4dbd-bf28-d59c55c51395', '4cc790ef-d492-41de-8ba1-5a351b6072c7', 'SKX-2026-4953', 'cybersecurity', '0245f49f-0429-47e7-aa87-04a09edeeb09', NULL, 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', NULL, 'https://lnkd.in/p/dP8ZCeyZ', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, NULL, 'Kyatham Meenakshi', 'meenakshikyatham07@gmail.com', '2026-09-24 10:59:15', '2026-09-24 12:32:43', 0, '0245f49f-0429-47e7-aa87-04a09edeeb09', 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', '', 'https://lnkd.in/p/dP8ZCeyZ', '2026-09-24 10:59:15', '2026-09-24 12:32:43'),
  ('9ca3a052-9879-407b-9dfc-998a0231c669', '401cde19-87ad-4060-8553-7cce8905fc38', '2bbce190-3877-4af3-bdfd-9dc1336c17a1', 'SKX-2026-3268', 'python', '76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08', 3, 'File Management Utility', 'https://github.com/vaishnavi-05-wq/Task4_File_Management_Utility', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'Completed a Python-based File Management Utility using pathlib and shutil. The application supports file listing, folder creation, file copying, moving, renaming, deletion with confirmation, recursive search, file information, input validation, error handling, and automated unit testing. All 12 automated tests passed successfully, and the complete project has been uploaded to GitHub.', 'Vaishnavi chouhan', 'vaishnavisinghchouhan717@gmail.com', '2026-09-21 20:12:16', '2026-09-22 00:57:17', 0, '76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08', 'File Management Utility', 'https://github.com/vaishnavi-05-wq/Task4_File_Management_Utility', '', '2026-09-21 20:12:16', '2026-09-22 00:57:17'),
  ('252607c7-3282-4e44-8133-12178aa5c012', 'e257c9ca-af94-4448-abdf-b7c156405acb', '55eab4f3-ad40-44d9-84f7-ef2a138fa7d7', 'SKX-2026-1263', 'python', '76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08', 3, 'File Management Utility', 'https://github.com/srinitya543-bot/File-Management-Utility/blob/main/README.md', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/55eab4f3-ad40-44d9-84f7-ef2a138fa7d7/76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08/1790062584852_1000087770.jpg', 'approved', NULL, 'Image of the Gemini app icon.\nChat with Gemini in an app.\nNow available on Google Play.\nConversation with Gemini\nHere is a professional, well-structured description you can use for the Notes section of your File Management Utility task submission:   \nJPG\n\nSuggested Notes for Submission\nApproach: Designed and implemented a modular file management utility focused on efficient directory traversal, secure file operations, and a streamlined user experience. The backend handles system-level file interactions safely with comprehensive error handling.\n\nCore Features:\n\nSeamless file uploading, downloading, renaming, and deletion.\n\nDirectory navigation and search functionality by filename and extension.\n\nReal-time operation logging and status feedback.\n\nTools & Technologies Used:\n\nLanguages & Frameworks: Python / Node.js (or specify your stack)\n\nLibraries: os, shutil, pathlib (or relevant backend/frontend tools)\n\nInterface: Clean, responsive UI for managing directory structures efficiently.', 'Katikireddy Srinitya', 'srinitya543@gmail.com', '2026-09-22 07:39:01', '2026-09-22 07:47:47', 0, '76a18d38-61a0-47d9-b206-32a96a8f1b08', 'File Management Utility', 'https://github.com/srinitya543-bot/File-Management-Utility/blob/main/README.md', '', '2026-09-22 07:39:01', '2026-09-22 07:47:47'),
