  ('729fc7ee-408a-42c1-9a42-c259cff61091', '55de6c38-1540-492b-8693-fed91bac712a', 'fa632755-6587-41e2-965d-35ad2602a3b3', 'SKX-2026-4949', 'fullstack', '06ac222a-6a69-45f2-9484-378cf016f0f5', 5, 'Job Portal', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/fa632755-6587-41e2-965d-35ad2602a3b3/06ac222a-6a69-45f2-9484-378cf016f0f5/1790093778270_55FBECB4-8DEE-4C51-9A8F-7DE4ADF7B3B8.png', 'approved', 'Needs Revision — Missing live demo URL or project screenshot.', '* Developed a full-stack Job Portal with a responsive web interface for job seekers and recruiters.\n* Implemented database integration for managing users, job listings, companies, applications, and recruiter data.\n* Implemented CRUD operations for creating, viewing, updating, and deleting job postings.\n* Added job search and filtering by job title, skills, location, job type, experience level, and salary range.\n* Implemented form validation for user registration, job postings, profiles, and applications.\n* Developed job seeker functionality for browsing jobs, viewing job details, saving jobs, and submitting applications.\n* Added recruiter functionality for posting and managing job vacancies.\n* Implemented application management to track submitted job applications and statuses.\n* Created a centralized job dashboard displaying latest job openings, active jobs, companies, and job seeker statistics.\n* Added company and recruiter sections for improved job discovery and recruitment management.\n* Implemented responsive UI/UX for desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\n* Tested CRUD operations, database connectivity, search/filter functionality, form validation, job application workflow, and responsive behavior.\n* Documented the complete workflow covering user registration → job search → filtering → job application → application management → recruiter job posting.', 'Subham Datta', 'subhomdatta.priority@gmail.com', '2026-09-22 16:16:20', '2026-09-22 16:38:29', 0, '06ac222a-6a69-45f2-9484-378cf016f0f5', 'Job Portal', '', '', '2026-09-22 16:16:20', '2026-09-22 16:38:29'),
  ('13718083-74b0-4086-9a2c-f2c86625ec16', 'd21defd2-7d0e-481b-8868-b30f73dcaa69', 'f49d07a0-6db5-4873-9663-c4a95bb1a4c9', 'SKX-2026-9128', 'datascience', '2a7df09c-2b98-4d14-9d48-940072cfeeca', 1, 'Sales Data Analysis', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/f49d07a0-6db5-4873-9663-c4a95bb1a4c9/2a7df09c-2b98-4d14-9d48-940072cfeeca/1790095746180_Sales%20Data%20Analysis.ipynb', NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'In this project, I conducted a comprehensive Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA) and data cleansing routine on a Superstore Sales dataset (train.csv) containing 9,800 transactional line items and 18 attributes using Python and Pandas. I evaluated the dataset\'s structural integrity, confirming zero duplicate records and pinpointing minimal missing data limited to just 11 Postal Code entries (0.11%). Through descriptive statistical analysis across 4,922 unique orders, i uncovered a right-skewed sales distribution with an average sale of $230.77 per line item, a median of $54.49, and a maximum order value of $22,638.48. I also categorized business operations across geographic regions, product divisions, and fulfillment methods, identifying California and New York City as major sales clusters, Office Supplies as the most frequent category, and Standard Class as the primary shipping choice. Finally, i outlined actionable data transformation steps—such as casting date fields into datetime formats, calculating shipping lead times, and imputing missing location attributes—to lay the ground for building interactive analytics dashboards.', 'Aman', 'amansharma.snc@gmail.com', '2026-09-22 16:49:14', '2026-09-22 17:05:16', 0, '2a7df09c-2b98-4d14-9d48-940072cfeeca', 'Sales Data Analysis', '', '', '2026-09-22 16:49:14', '2026-09-22 17:05:16'),
