  ('183489b9-e555-43ed-a3d3-1bb817548ca1', 'd6b663d6-a173-42b4-b0c3-87e6be7bdcd2', '03fde2db-f55d-4190-95d1-8345803e28aa', 'SKX-2026-1782', 'fullstack', '29bfaac4-e233-47de-9dd9-59b7cb8b9a52', NULL, 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', NULL, 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7508204236283731969/', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, NULL, 'Sayan Das', 'saiyandas06@gmail.com', '2026-09-22 17:05:30', '2026-09-22 17:06:20', 0, '29bfaac4-e233-47de-9dd9-59b7cb8b9a52', 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', '', 'https://www.linkedin.com/feed/update/urn:li:activity:7508204236283731969/', '2026-09-22 17:05:30', '2026-09-22 17:06:20'),
  ('4761db0b-4092-4215-9407-d672c47c203d', 'd21defd2-7d0e-481b-8868-b30f73dcaa69', 'f49d07a0-6db5-4873-9663-c4a95bb1a4c9', 'SKX-2026-9128', 'datascience', '23ef07ab-8981-4e44-ad0f-599f56f32984', NULL, 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', NULL, 'https://lnkd.in/p/dQ94Y4Pw', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'The Sales Data Analysis project focuses on analyzing sales data to identify important business patterns, trends, and insights that can support better decision-making. The project involves data preprocessing and exploratory data analysis using **Python**, primarily with **Pandas and NumPy** for data manipulation and **Matplotlib and Seaborn** for data visualization. The dataset is examined to understand sales performance across different categories, regions, customers, and time periods. Various analyses and visualizations are performed to study sales distribution, monthly and yearly trends, category-wise performance, regional sales patterns, and relationships between important variables. Data cleaning techniques such as handling missing values, removing duplicate records, and preparing data for analysis are applied to improve data quality. The project uses graphical representations such as bar charts, line charts, distribution plots, and correlation analysis to make the findings easier to understand. Overall, this project demonstrates practical skills in **data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, statistical understanding, visualization, and business-oriented interpretation of sales data**, helping identify patterns that can be useful for evaluating sales performance and improving business strategies.', 'Aman', 'amansharma.snc@gmail.com', '2026-09-22 10:22:09', '2026-09-22 11:09:17', 0, '23ef07ab-8981-4e44-ad0f-599f56f32984', 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', '', 'https://lnkd.in/p/dQ94Y4Pw', '2026-09-22 10:22:09', '2026-09-22 11:09:17'),
