  ('deeb066c-ecd0-4d5e-9ead-59bed5ac748a', 'af09611d-74c4-4280-a378-60870d47015f', '7f477e14-e2aa-4a55-ad14-2d09faa2b706', 'SKX-2026-1229', 'cloudcomputing', '7a4c95de-d8d2-46de-997a-65a5a8309d7a', 11, 'Cloud Notification Service', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/7f477e14-e2aa-4a55-ad14-2d09faa2b706/7a4c95de-d8d2-46de-997a-65a5a8309d7a/1790843684818_Cloud_Notification_Service_Project.pdf', NULL, 'approved', NULL, NULL, 'Rahul Singh', 'rahul7035singh@gmail.com', '2026-10-01 08:34:45', '2026-10-01 09:19:03', 0, '7a4c95de-d8d2-46de-997a-65a5a8309d7a', 'Cloud Notification Service', '', '', '2026-10-01 08:34:45', '2026-10-01 09:19:03'),
  ('ec923bf3-dd29-431d-8412-0fd2469c2626', '110dbb92-150a-4f76-be8f-98f285666281', 'd598dfb1-f9f4-4835-abab-19aa3b216814', 'SKX-2026-1920', 'python', '110857f3-43eb-4e53-ae61-eddb4cd458ea', 2, 'Student Result Analyzer', 'https://github.com/musahanifa2425-glitch/Student-Result-Analyzer', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/d598dfb1-f9f4-4835-abab-19aa3b216814/110857f3-43eb-4e53-ae61-eddb4cd458ea/1790828988954_Screenshot%202026-10-01%20095700.png', 'approved', NULL, 'Built a Student Result Analyzer in Python (Tkinter for GUI, CSV for input/output). The app reads a CSV file of student marks, automatically computes total, average, percentage, letter grade, and pass/fail status for each student, and can export the fully analyzed report back out as a new CSV.\n\nImplemented full input validation (required Name/RollNumber columns, numeric marks within 0–100 range, missing/malformed row detection) and custom exception handling for both file-level errors (missing/corrupted CSV) and row-level errors (bad data in a specific row doesn\'t stop the rest of the file from processing — errors are collected and shown separately).\n\nProject is split into modules for maintainability: gui.py (interface), result_processor.py (core data processing — grading logic, pass/fail rules), data_handler.py (CSV file reading), validators.py (input validation), and exceptions.py (custom errors). Included a unittest suite with 19 test cases covering validation rules, grade boundaries, and error handling, plus a README documenting design decisions, CSV format, and setup steps.', 'SHAIKH MUSA', 'musahanifa2425@gmail.com', '2026-10-01 04:29:51', '2026-10-01 05:14:41', 0, '110857f3-43eb-4e53-ae61-eddb4cd458ea', 'Student Result Analyzer', 'https://github.com/musahanifa2425-glitch/Student-Result-Analyzer', '', '2026-10-01 04:29:51', '2026-10-01 05:14:41'),
  ('42832878-8eef-4c21-9e7a-6506788d8be0', 'b5967e71-8758-4c55-9b68-2415c4100ab0', '1bb8e3bf-bac2-4af0-8006-920f2e091fbf', 'SKX-2026-9358', 'fullstack', '50b6c5a9-5b92-47be-a22f-f29179233c49', 3, 'Online Course Platform', 'https://github.com/ankitsharma776/online-course-platform?utm_source=chatgpt.com', NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/1bb8e3bf-bac2-4af0-8006-920f2e091fbf/50b6c5a9-5b92-47be-a22f-f29179233c49/1791423969953_Online_Course_Platform_Project_Report.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/1bb8e3bf-bac2-4af0-8006-920f2e091fbf/50b6c5a9-5b92-47be-a22f-f29179233c49/1791423970755_aaScreenshot%202026-10-07%2018293533ankit.png', 'approved', NULL, NULL, 'Ankit Sharma', 'ankitsharma952078@gmail.com', '2026-10-08 01:46:11', '2026-10-08 02:03:46', 0, '50b6c5a9-5b92-47be-a22f-f29179233c49', 'Online Course Platform', 'https://github.com/ankitsharma776/online-course-platform?utm_source=chatgpt.com', '', '2026-10-08 01:46:11', '2026-10-08 02:03:46'),
  ('c7cb25b0-1baf-44d9-8ae5-cb9f5b05ce18', '2704bad9-5ea8-4079-8f69-91e63ce43421', '8ab5a8f0-f879-4f3f-89eb-e751219b31e3', 'SKX-2026-9685', 'cybersecurity', '4539f9de-8d65-4742-aa05-ef06d1aa9474', 1, 'Secure Login System', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/8ab5a8f0-f879-4f3f-89eb-e751219b31e3/4539f9de-8d65-4742-aa05-ef06d1aa9474/1791464628151_Secure_Login_System_Project_Report-1.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/8ab5a8f0-f879-4f3f-89eb-e751219b31e3/4539f9de-8d65-4742-aa05-ef06d1aa9474/1791464634866_1000276180.png', 'approved', NULL, 'I developed a Secure Login System using Python, Flask, and SQLite. The project focuses on secure user registration and login, password hashing, input validation, protection against SQL injection, basic login rate limiting, and security event logging. I also included security awareness tips and test cases to demonstrate the system\'s security features. The project report and supporting files are attached for review.', 'Thagirancha Spoorthy', 'spoorthy.thagirancha@gmail.com', '2026-10-08 13:05:31', '2026-10-08 13:34:24', 0, '4539f9de-8d65-4742-aa05-ef06d1aa9474', 'Secure Login System', '', '', '2026-10-08 13:05:31', '2026-10-08 13:34:24'),
  ('1c892492-451a-4d31-a6b8-de12e720cc80', '2a0d049e-0868-4e18-8b96-eb150ce44b1d', '8677d9bc-74b0-4efa-bbf7-cefa8b1b6ee5', 'SKX-2026-1698', 'python', '9924e7db-95aa-487e-b761-3f0a30955461', 4, 'Weather Dashboard', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/8677d9bc-74b0-4efa-bbf7-cefa8b1b6ee5/9924e7db-95aa-487e-b761-3f0a30955461/1791474500151_Weather_Dashboard_Project_Submission.pdf', NULL, 'approved', NULL, NULL, 'Raj Tripathi', 'rajtripathi7099@gmail.com', '2026-10-08 15:48:20', '2026-10-08 23:47:59', 0, '9924e7db-95aa-487e-b761-3f0a30955461', 'Weather Dashboard', '', '', '2026-10-08 15:48:20', '2026-10-08 23:47:59'),
  ('301170d7-339b-4cdf-8ada-9b59dc8b2fa7', '3ae38172-b1e3-4440-ae84-1ab793542274', '9c25dae2-518d-4c07-be0b-941cedf4fbb9', 'SKX-2026-1990', 'mernstack', 'b8c0c904-d051-4581-8932-4d02f532375d', 4, 'Job Portal', 'https://github.com/Nandhinij-17/job-portal-mern', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/9c25dae2-518d-4c07-be0b-941cedf4fbb9/b8c0c904-d051-4581-8932-4d02f532375d/1791556741810_Screenshot%202026-10-09%20200713.png', 'approved', 'Approved — Good attempt, completed all required features.', NULL, 'Nandhini J', 'nandhinij1727@gmail.com', '2026-10-09 14:39:02', '2026-10-09 16:24:07', 0, 'b8c0c904-d051-4581-8932-4d02f532375d', 'Job Portal', 'https://github.com/Nandhinij-17/job-portal-mern', '', '2026-10-09 14:39:02', '2026-10-09 16:24:07'),
  ('e496ae0d-b4f7-4dc1-a569-cf30e65460c6', 'a06e0d44-725a-48a9-bebc-712fbc05921c', '998464ec-d08f-498d-9ed1-b833ea4957d9', 'SKX-2026-1242', 'genai', 'b3512597-f4ca-4d31-8134-58326c6fd120', 1, 'AI Chatbot', 'https://github.com/Sathiq17/AI-Chatbot.git', NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/998464ec-d08f-498d-9ed1-b833ea4957d9/b3512597-f4ca-4d31-8134-58326c6fd120/1791564223940_AI_Chatbot_Project_Report.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/998464ec-d08f-498d-9ed1-b833ea4957d9/b3512597-f4ca-4d31-8134-58326c6fd120/1791564224445_Screenshot%202026-10-06%20090500.png', 'approved', NULL, '**Project: AI Chatbot Using Generative AI and Prompt Engineering**\n\nI developed an AI chatbot using Python, Streamlit, Ollama, and the Llama 3.2 model. The project uses prompt engineering to guide responses, maintains conversation context, and generates AI responses through a local language model. I tested the chatbot with sample questions. The project runs locally without requiring paid OpenAI API credits.', 'SHEIK SAGUBAR SATHIQ', 'ssathik2004@gmail.com', '2026-10-09 16:43:44', '2026-10-10 00:53:21', 0, 'b3512597-f4ca-4d31-8134-58326c6fd120', 'AI Chatbot', 'https://github.com/Sathiq17/AI-Chatbot.git', '', '2026-10-09 16:43:44', '2026-10-10 00:53:21'),
  ('8918d98a-69b8-42ba-a152-72a2c0b65d74', 'ffbf38e1-a2ef-4fe3-b124-60f3299c6947', 'f5b5075a-f4da-4f8e-aa2d-9a5d5c203153', 'SKX-2026-9310', 'aiml', '0b3cabca-1df5-4a58-86c7-c7f305a24a6a', 1, 'House Price Prediction', 'https://github.com/mali30412/house-price-prediction.git', NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/f5b5075a-f4da-4f8e-aa2d-9a5d5c203153/0b3cabca-1df5-4a58-86c7-c7f305a24a6a/1791616212486_Project_PDF.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/f5b5075a-f4da-4f8e-aa2d-9a5d5c203153/0b3cabca-1df5-4a58-86c7-c7f305a24a6a/1791616213373_Screenshot.png', 'approved', NULL, 'End-to-end regression pipeline in Python (scikit-learn). Data preprocessing: removed duplicates and outliers (IQR rule), imputed missing values (median/mode), scaled numeric features, one-hot encoded neighborhood and ordinal-encoded condition, all inside a Pipeline to prevent data leakage. Model training: compared Linear Regression, Ridge, Random Forest and Gradient Boosting using 5-fold cross-validation, then tuned the best (Gradient Boosting) with GridSearchCV. Evaluation: on a 20% hold-out set the tuned model achieved R2 = 0.938, MAE ~ $21.9k, RMSE ~ $30.0k; plots included (actual vs predicted, residuals, feature importance). Prediction interface: Flask web app with a form and /predict JSON API with input validation. Testing: 4 automated tests (cleaning, preprocessing, model sanity, API). Tools: Python, pandas, scikit-learn, matplotlib, seaborn, Flask, joblib. Note: trained on a generated dataset with realistic price relationships; the code accepts any real CSV via python train.py --data file.csv.', 'Muhammad Ali', 'm.ali200236@gmail.com', '2026-10-10 07:10:13', '2026-10-10 09:02:36', 0, '0b3cabca-1df5-4a58-86c7-c7f305a24a6a', 'House Price Prediction', 'https://github.com/mali30412/house-price-prediction.git', '', '2026-10-10 07:10:13', '2026-10-10 09:02:36'),
