  ('40fed614-4033-4ffe-bce3-8ec72516bd02', 'd21defd2-7d0e-481b-8868-b30f73dcaa69', 'f49d07a0-6db5-4873-9663-c4a95bb1a4c9', 'SKX-2026-9128', 'datascience', 'ccc4b003-4b13-42a5-aab5-ace50c413829', 2, 'Customer Behavior Analysis', 'https://github.com/Aman-coder78629/Customer-Behaviour-Analysis/tree/main', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'Customer Behaviour Analysis is a data analytics project focused on understanding customer purchasing patterns, preferences, and behaviour using an e-commerce dataset. The project involves data cleaning, preprocessing, exploratory analysis, statistical analysis, visualization, customer segmentation, and KPI analysis. Various trends such as customer demographics, purchase amounts, product categories, ratings, and shopping behaviour were analyzed to identify meaningful patterns and business insights. The results can help businesses understand customers, improve marketing strategies, enhance customer experience, and support data-driven decision-making.', 'Aman', 'amansharma.snc@gmail.com', '2026-10-01 19:28:07', '2026-10-02 00:39:55', 0, 'ccc4b003-4b13-42a5-aab5-ace50c413829', 'Customer Behavior Analysis', 'https://github.com/Aman-coder78629/Customer-Behaviour-Analysis/tree/main', '', '2026-10-01 19:28:07', '2026-10-02 00:39:55'),
