  ('5b175c59-4ad5-4595-8aa9-dbe8e7042c0b', '51e3df86-5360-4b9b-9cd4-994966c2682d', 'ed201f81-1b5b-4610-82af-8097ac4993e4', 'SKX-2026-7609', 'dataanalytics', '37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0', 1, 'Sales Dashboard', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/ed201f81-1b5b-4610-82af-8097ac4993e4/37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0/1791886540668_Skyrovix_Sales_Dashboard_Starter.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/ed201f81-1b5b-4610-82af-8097ac4993e4/37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0/1791886541430_Sales_Dashboard_Screenshot.png..png', 'approved', NULL, 'I developed a Sales Dashboard using Microsoft Excel as part of my Skyrovix virtual internship. The project includes sales data preparation, KPI calculations, filters, charts, and business insights. I used Excel formulas to calculate sales and profit and created visualizations to analyze monthly sales, regional performance, and product-category profitability. The project uses a simulated dataset for demonstration and learning purposes.', 'Sanjana C E', 'sirisanju9945@gmail.com', '2026-10-13 10:15:41', '2026-10-13 14:57:48', 0, '37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0', 'Sales Dashboard', '', '', '2026-10-13 10:15:41', '2026-10-13 14:57:48'),
  ('5be57e62-05d8-480f-ae4f-3192d59ef089', '2b491870-f2e0-4b5b-89f4-099070e0a4ad', 'c43ad7f6-c690-4e19-8039-e6e0621cb03a', 'SKX-2026-2631', 'dataanalytics', 'aab40e43-f9bc-47d4-9972-5f6816652c76', NULL, 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', NULL, 'https://lnkd.in/p/dfV3NR55', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'Shared my internship announcement on linkedIn for review', 'Prajakta Narwade', 'sumitgote8586@gmail.com', '2026-10-13 14:37:52', '2026-10-13 14:59:04', 0, 'aab40e43-f9bc-47d4-9972-5f6816652c76', 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', '', 'https://lnkd.in/p/dfV3NR55', '2026-10-13 14:37:52', '2026-10-13 14:59:04'),
  ('a1a2cb12-0d14-44a5-9230-13879af20eab', 'e22cef32-2fac-4339-9d6a-17b09d873070', '77090204-9dd7-4b16-8391-4f287a534be5', 'SKX-2026-1222', 'aiml', 'd0c2cf97-a4ab-4bbe-af42-a2cc703819fb', NULL, 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', NULL, 'https://lnkd.in/p/g2HVsG_X', NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'I have shared my Skyrovix internship offer letter on LinkedIn to showcase my internship journey and professional growth. I have included the required hashtag #SkyrovixInternship and tagged @Skyrovix. This task helped me improve my professional networking and build my online presence.', 'Aishwarya M', 'maishu435@gmail.com', '2026-10-14 06:50:58', '2026-10-14 09:20:41', 0, 'd0c2cf97-a4ab-4bbe-af42-a2cc703819fb', 'Share Your Offer Letter on LinkedIn', '', 'https://lnkd.in/p/g2HVsG_X', '2026-10-14 06:50:58', '2026-10-14 09:20:41'),
  ('20a43644-70a5-4f0f-b7ca-48f9de6aac7d', 'c1c7e7a0-214b-49be-96cb-6ff92c7a5785', 'fa37d186-b798-45d2-81f6-82f9b64877ac', 'SKX-2026-9039', 'datascience', 'a6670dfa-17c9-4914-a2c3-e858ee8315f6', 3, 'Student Performance Analysis', 'https://mcprathiksha05-student-performance-analysis--app-iu8we1.streamlit.app/', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'approved', NULL, '# Student Performance Analysis Using Python\n\n## Overview\nStudent Performance Analysis is a data science project that analyzes students\' academic performance using Python and exploratory data analysis techniques. The project uses the Student Performance dataset from the UCI Machine Learning Repository, containing 395 student records with information about grades, study time, school absences, previous failures, and other academic and personal factors.\n\nThe main objective is to understand student performance patterns, identify factors associated with academic outcomes, and generate meaningful insights through data analysis and visualization.\n\n## Objectives\n- Clean and preprocess student data to improve data quality.\n- Analyze students\' academic grades using descriptive statistics.\n- Explore relationships between study time, absences, previous failures, and final grades.\n- Visualize grade distributions and academic patterns using charts.\n- Calculate student pass rates and performance summaries.\n- Generate reports and data-driven recommendations to support academic analysis.\n\n## Tools and Technologies\n- **Python:** Core programming language.\n- **Pandas:** Data manipulation and analysis.\n- **NumPy:** Numerical calculations.\n- **Matplotlib:** Data visualization.\n- **Seaborn:** Statistical charts and correlation heatmaps.\n\n## Key Features\n1. **Data Cleaning:** Handles duplicate records, missing values, and grade validation.\n2. **Exploratory Data Analysis:** Examines grade distributions and academic patterns.\n3. **Statistical Analysis:** Calculates averages, medians, pass rates, and correlations.\n4. **Data Visualization:** Generates charts for grade distribution, study time, absences, and correlations.\n5. **Automated Reporting:** Produces statistical summaries and a text report.\n6. **Actionable Insights:** Highlights patterns that may help educators identify areas for further investigation.\n\n## Key Findings\nAnalysis of the 395 student records produced the following results:\n- Average final mathematics grade: **10.42 out of 20**.\n- Median final mathematics grade: **11 out of 20**.\n- Pass rate, using a threshold of 10 out of 20: **67.09%**.\n- Correlation between study time and final grade: **0.098**.\n- Correlation between absences and final grade: **0.034**.\n\nThese results indicate weak linear relationships between study time or absences and final grades in this dataset. Correlation does not establish causation, and other factors may also influence academic performance.\n\n## Project Outcomes\nThe project generates a cleaned dataset, descriptive statistics, study-time summaries, visualizations, and a report containing findings and recommendations. It demonstrates practical applications of data cleaning, exploratory data analysis, statistical interpretation, and data visualization.\n\n## Dataset Source\nUCI Machine Learning Repository — Student Performance Dataset:\nhttps://archive.ics.uci.edu/dataset/320/student%2Bperformance\n\n## Conclusion\nThis project demonstrates how Python-based data science techniques can be used to examine student academic performance and communicate findings through visualizations and reports. The analysis provides a foundation for further research into student learning patterns and academic support strategies.', 'M C Prathiksha', 'mcprathiksha1405@gmail.com', '2026-10-12 04:05:06', '2026-10-12 05:14:17', 0, 'a6670dfa-17c9-4914-a2c3-e858ee8315f6', 'Student Performance Analysis', 'https://mcprathiksha05-student-performance-analysis--app-iu8we1.streamlit.app/', '', '2026-10-12 04:05:06', '2026-10-12 05:14:17'),
