  ('f5d55a59-4705-4922-8384-685ca750feb4', '6587cf4c-7fc9-4e8d-9f11-a0e52b41330c', 'e5b70a98-5b68-47e0-a0bb-bf61aed45e02', 'SKX-2026-8853', 'fullstack', 'd3c14b38-3a77-4a45-b2d4-3877c31709df', 2, 'Student Management Portal', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/e5b70a98-5b68-47e0-a0bb-bf61aed45e02/d3c14b38-3a77-4a45-b2d4-3877c31709df/1792402841258_Student_Management_Portal_Project_Report.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/e5b70a98-5b68-47e0-a0bb-bf61aed45e02/d3c14b38-3a77-4a45-b2d4-3877c31709df/1792402845447_1000118052.png', 'approved', NULL, 'Student Management Portal developed using Python Flask, SQLite, HTML and CSS. Includes responsive UI, CRUD operations, search functionality, input validation, database integration, documentation and a testing checklist.', 'Gopinathan B', 'gopinathan542005@gmail.com', '2026-10-19 09:40:46', '2026-10-19 12:13:22', 0, 'd3c14b38-3a77-4a45-b2d4-3877c31709df', 'Student Management Portal', '', '', '2026-10-19 09:40:46', '2026-10-19 12:13:22'),
  ('bc8fef1d-498f-47c1-9050-0b4a03904ef2', '5e26f83f-a2d0-4059-82f0-3894ee857758', '6aed8d44-8c14-433f-9d07-c1b69a44fd27', 'SKX-2026-8428', 'aiml', '0b57fa84-0ae4-4908-b508-27cfafdebc5b', 4, 'Customer Churn Prediction', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/6aed8d44-8c14-433f-9d07-c1b69a44fd27/0b57fa84-0ae4-4908-b508-27cfafdebc5b/1792452623602_Customer_Churn_Dashboard_and_Report.pdf', NULL, 'approved', NULL, 'I developed a Customer Churn Prediction project using Python and Machine Learning. The project includes data preprocessing, dataset preparation, model training, and performance evaluation. I used Pandas and NumPy for data handling and Scikit-learn for building and evaluating the machine learning models, including Logistic Regression, Random Forest, and Gradient Boosting. The system predicts whether a customer is likely to churn based on the input features and provides results, including a churn probability and risk level, through a Gradio prediction interface. The project was tested using pytest to verify its functionality and prediction accuracy.', 'Silambarason R', 'silambarason05@gmail.com', '2026-10-19 23:30:24', '2026-10-20 10:23:46', 0, '0b57fa84-0ae4-4908-b508-27cfafdebc5b', 'Customer Churn Prediction', '', '', '2026-10-19 23:30:24', '2026-10-20 10:23:46'),
  ('965b65e9-8a81-4117-9c76-db488d334f0e', '42e935bd-10c2-44e3-941b-1cde0774e9f9', '5f1d27c7-18db-4087-999f-9eddd58ac3d2', 'SKX-2026-6559', 'dataanalytics', '37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0', 1, 'Sales Dashboard', 'https://github.com/FathimaFarhana6852/sales-performance-dashboard', NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/5f1d27c7-18db-4087-999f-9eddd58ac3d2/37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0/1792060606775_SALES%20PERFORMANCE%20DASHBOARD%20REPORT%20AND%20WORKFLOW.pdf', 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/5f1d27c7-18db-4087-999f-9eddd58ac3d2/37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0/1792060607489_sales%20performance%20dashboard.png', 'approved', NULL, '**Project: Sales Performance Dashboard using Power BI**\n\nI developed an interactive sales dashboard using Microsoft Power BI, Power Query, and DAX. The project includes data preparation, KPI cards, sales analysis by category and region, monthly sales trends, customer segment analysis, and interactive filters.\n\nThe dashboard tracks Total Sales, Total Profit, Total Orders, Average Order Value, and Profit Margin. The workflow and testing checks are being documented, and the dashboard will be validated before final submission.\n\nThis project helped me practise data analysis, dashboard development, data visualization, and business reporting.', 'Fathima Farhana', 'fathimafarhana.bca25.dbi@gmail.com', '2026-10-15 10:36:47', '2026-10-16 06:06:22', 0, '37e4aef3-4508-4613-a891-c9d140934ca0', 'Sales Dashboard', 'https://github.com/FathimaFarhana6852/sales-performance-dashboard', '', '2026-10-15 10:36:47', '2026-10-16 06:06:22'),
