  ('56640779-e057-4dad-bf75-ba01a590011f', '5e26f83f-a2d0-4059-82f0-3894ee857758', '6aed8d44-8c14-433f-9d07-c1b69a44fd27', 'SKX-2026-8428', 'aiml', 'b854a944-9916-4e08-9035-c230e80be1a3', 5, 'Sentiment Analysis App', NULL, NULL, 'https://eesiuqeswydlmwhecrcy.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/task-submissions/6aed8d44-8c14-433f-9d07-c1b69a44fd27/b854a944-9916-4e08-9035-c230e80be1a3/1792581310704_Sentiment_Analysis_Dashboard_and_Report.pdf', NULL, 'pending', NULL, 'Developed a Sentiment Analysis App to analyze text and identify whether the expressed sentiment is positive, negative, or neutral. The application uses Natural Language Processing (NLP) techniques to process the input text and determine its sentiment. The project focuses on text preprocessing, sentiment classification, and displaying the result through a simple and user-friendly interface. The tools and technologies used include Python, NLP libraries, and a suitable machine learning approach. This project demonstrates how sentiment analysis can be applied to customer reviews, social media comments, and feedback analysis.', 'Silambarason R', 'silambarason05@gmail.com', '2026-10-21 11:15:11', NULL, 0, 'b854a944-9916-4e08-9035-c230e80be1a3', 'Sentiment Analysis App', '', '', '2026-10-21 11:15:11', '2026-10-21 11:15:11'),
